&lt;p&gt;Let’s get this out of the way — what is “gravy blood”, and who is “Damp”?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This whole project started as an inside joke. My buddy and I would say we had gravy blood whenever we overindulged in a meal. That sluggish, heavy feeling afterward? In our lore, that’s the gravy blood kicking in.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>